# The context is `docker/`, and only two things in it belong in an image. An
# exclude-all with two exceptions rather than a list of things to skip, so that
# a stray file dropped in here — a scratch binary, an editor backup — cannot
# silently become a layer.
#
# `!context` re-includes the DIRECTORY: Docker skips the contents of an excluded
# directory outright, so excepting `context/**` alone would match nothing.
*
!config.zon
!context
